flowchart TD
    Start([Browser lands on PoMiniGames]) --> AppRazor[App.razor renders]
    AppRazor --> AuthGate[AuthGate wraps Router<br/>no layout flash]
    AuthGate --> Provider[Custom AuthenticationStateProvider<br/>calls /auth/me]
    Provider -->|/auth/me 200 cookie| Authed[Authenticated branch]
    Provider -->|/auth/me 401 anon| Anon[Anonymous branch]
    Anon --> LoginScreen[LoginScreen.razor]
    LoginScreen -->|env=Development or Test| GuestBtn[Show Continue as Guest]
    LoginScreen -->|env=Production| NoGuest[Hide guest button]
    GuestBtn -->|opt-in AutoGuestLogin| FakeLogin[/auth/login/fake?autoGuest=1/]
    FakeLogin -->|loopback peer| DevCookie[Issue PoMiniGames.DevAuth<br/>HttpOnly + SameSite=Lax cookie]
    FakeLogin -->|non-loopback| DevDeny[404 - dev/test only]
    NoGuest --> MSLogin[/auth/login/microsoft/]
    MSLogin --> EntraChallenge[Entra ID OIDC challenge]
    EntraChallenge --> Authority{Authority: common/v2.0<br/>multitenant + personal}
    Authority --> IssuerValidate[MicrosoftAuthIssuerValidator]
    IssuerValidate --> AllowList{Issuer in allow-list:<br/>common / organizations / consumers<br/>or AllowedTenantIds?}
    AllowList -->|no| IssuerReject[401 - tenant not allowed]
    AllowList -->|yes| Callback[/signin-oidc callback/]
    Callback --> TokenMint[Validate token signature + audience]
    TokenMint --> CookieIssue[Issue auth cookie<br/>HttpOnly + Secure + SameSite=Lax]
    IssuerReject --> LoginScreen
    DevCookie --> MeCheck[/auth/me local-path gate/]
    CookieIssue --> MeCheck
    MeCheck --> ReturnUrlCheck{returnUrl is local path?}
    ReturnUrlCheck -->|yes local| Redirect[302 to returnUrl]
    ReturnUrlCheck -->|no external| RejectExternal[Reject - only local paths allowed]
    DevDeny --> LoginScreen
    Redirect --> Authed
    RejectExternal --> LoginScreen
    Authed --> Done([Same-origin WASM + cookie set])